      "id": "claim_f24299a3a1a542c493d34545f389eee3",
      "statement": "provenance.content_hash is sha256 over the canonical (path-sorted) serialization of files; validateBundle recomputes it and rejects any mismatch, and also checks file_count matches the array length, that dependencies.integrity.content_hash matches provenance.content_hash, and that every file path is a safe relative path (no leading /, no backslash, no .. or . traversal, no null bytes).",
      "evidence": [
