      "id": "claim_b959d7b10b2547f597646b496f7a26ae",
      "statement": "Export profiles filter files by resolved portability class: PROFILE_INCLUDES keeps structural+tenant_private+resource_bound for backup, and structural+resource_bound for template and sale (tenant_private excluded); a host must reject a template/sale export that would emit a tenant_private file.",
