      "statement": "For each resource_bound requirement, export generates a bind-<type> provisioning step (system mapped from the resource kind: domain->domains, email/mailbox->email, phone_number->phone, else accounts; mode provision; required true) and a workspace-scoped user parameter per bound field, unless an alias for that field already exists in manifest.parameters.",
