      "id": "claim_acae79883c934a7a89b1cdfe8750867f",
      "statement": "provisionBundle resolves and type-checks parameters (string/boolean/number), fails on unresolved required params, applies x_bind frontmatter bindings and resource_bound REQUIREMENT-to-parameter resolution, and records each binding; an unbound required resource is a plan error unless dry_run.",
