    {
      "id": "claim_70410150188f4071b29c5c420979de64",
      "statement": "Id-remap: a --prefix relocates every file under the target path, remaps each file's slug and id to a deterministic prefix-scoped sha256(workspace_id+':'+slug) value, sets workspace_id, and rewrites both frontmatter reference paths and body [[links]]/[text](rel.md) links to follow the remap; every internal link that resolved in the source must resolve in the target or provision reports it as a dangling link and the plan fails.",
      "evidence": [
