      "id": "claim_b5cb32cb2cf34f4ca22509df24cb3a5f",
      "statement": "Each provisioned envelope's idempotency key is 'prov-' + sha256(workspace_id + ':' + path + ':' + contentDigest) truncated to 24 chars, so re-importing the same plan commits nothing new; import reports the unchanged/idempotent count rather than rewriting.",
