    {
      "id": "claim_bfe4ec365ca0419794d89ca91eb1dad1",
      "statement": "upgradeBundle moves an installed bundle to a new version by emitting only structural patch/operation envelopes: it skips tenant_private files in the next bundle and errors on any modification of an installed tenant_private file, emits a full operation envelope for new structural files, skips identical files, and emits a patch envelope (frontmatter or __body__ diff) guarded by an expected_before_hash for changed files; every upgrade also emits a migration primitive document recording from_version/to_version, status applied, and the modified paths.",
