      "id": "claim_1f97337e2a614fb78fe4eafcc7b8f97d",
      "statement": "validateBundle scopes its registry load to the bundle's own required_extensions, reports a named-but-absent extension as a validation error rather than crashing (falling back to the default composition so the remaining checks run), and rejects a bundle whose ssss_core_version the host does not support or that names an unloaded required extension before any file is committed.",
