      "id": "claim_18d459893d734943af1f390821d50456",
      "statement": "The canonical reference bundle (conformance/reference-bundle.ucw.json, a sale-profile 'Festival in a Box' export) is round-tripped by the conformance runner as validate -> provision -> import -> re-import, proving strict bundle shape validation, idempotency (re-import is a no-op), and that no tenant_private or seller-bound resource_bound value lands in the import.",
